--   `VehicleCatalog.BuildVehicle(selectedVehicleId, currentUpgrades)` and highlights the 3D upgrade parts
--   (`Plow`, `Engine`, `Armor`, `Nitro`, `Magnet`) directly on the 3D car as you click, hover, or upgrade them!

